      "attack_scenario": "An attacker (or malicious script) calls `supabase.schema('attendance').rpc('record_attendance_by_card', { p_card_id: '<target_card>' })` twice concurrently from any unauthenticated client; both calls select the same last type before either commits and both insert identical attendance records, corrupting the user's check-in/check-out state.",
